¬import il from "../../../../../_shared/variables/imageLinks"


2. In the Extensions panel search box type `Code Spell Checker`. *- yellow ring* 

3. All the extensions matching the search text are displayed. *- orange ring* 

4. Click the extension **Code Spell Checker**. *- blue ring* 

5. The **Code Spell Checker** extension is displayed. *- green ring*

6. Click either of the **Install** buttons. *- mauve rings* 

{{::il.Vscode_InstallCodeSpellChecker_3_img}}


7. If this is the first time you have installed an extension from `Street Side Software` the dialogue **Do you trust the publisher "Street Side Software"** is displayed. *- yellow ring* 

8. Click the **Trust Publisher & Install** button. *- red ring* 

{{::il.Vscode_InstallCodeSpellChecker_2_img}}


9. **Code Spell Checker** is installed and the extension page is updated. *- green ring* 

{{::il.Vscode_InstallCodeSpellChecker_3_img}}

